# VHS tape for docs/assets/demo.gif
# Generate with: vhs docs/assets/demo.tape
# Note: requires vhs installed; otherwise keep this tape only.

Output docs/assets/demo.gif
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "cargo run -- --demo --read-only --ascii"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "2"
Sleep 800ms
Type "j"
Sleep 200ms
Type "j"
Sleep 500ms
Type "3"
Sleep 800ms
Type "6"
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
